<section class="content-section" id="safety-intro">
    <div class="content-wrapper">

        <p>
            This page exists for one purpose: to give anyone in this community a clear,
            direct path to report a safety concern, harmful content, or abusive behavior&mdash;and
            to know what happens when they do.
        </p>
        <p>
            You are never bothering anyone by reporting. If something feels wrong, report it.
            That is what this is for.
        </p>

        <div class="feature-card" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-primary);">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-weight: 600;">If you are in immediate danger, please call 911.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                This community cares deeply about your safety, but it is not a substitute for
                professional emergency or crisis support. Please use the resources at the
                bottom of this page if you need help right now.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

